    "large_title": "Tanzeel Social Development Fund.",
    "description": "Tanzeel Social Development Fund (TSDF) is a dedicated fund established by Tanzeel Foundation to support sustainable community development initiatives. The fund mobilizes resources from philanthropic individuals, partners, and organizations to address social, educational, health, and humanitarian needs. Guided by Islamic values of compassion, charity, and accountability, TSDF finances programs that empower vulnerable groups, promote self reliance, and strengthen community resilience. Through transparent management and collective support, the fund aims to create lasting positive impact and improve the quality of life for communities served by Tanzeel Foundation. Together we build hope always.!",
